      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_ABBREV&lt;/color&gt;/$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_PASSIVE_ABBREV(&lt;color=#7CC6BC&gt;EO&lt;/color&gt;) - $MISSILEWARHEAD_SHORT_HEKP</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-H-3 Phase-100K Block II&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 waypoint-capable cruise missile.  It is based on the SGM-H-3 body, which is a high speed hybrid missile designed to strike heavy targets.  This missile will deliver a $MISSILEWARHEAD_DETAIL_HEKP warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Passive Electro-Optical seeker.

